, 2026 / rating-4-of-5\\\" with the exact comment; restaurant 2's review list still shows only its own review (Emily K.).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied WEEKEND20 → toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 20% off weekend dining\\\" and form showed \\\"WEEKEND20 / - 20% off\\\"; remove button cleared it; applied GROUP15 (6 guests) → \\\"- 15% off\\\"; after submitting, reservation card shows \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker (today = Aug 27, 2026): all gridcells Aug 1–27 and prior-month days rendered [disabled]; Aug 28+ selectable. Selected Aug 29, 2026 and combined it with restaurant-specific time 19:00 from Sakura Garden's available slots (12:00–13:00, 18:00–20:00); both values persisted in the form.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be modified\", \"actual\": \"The Modify Reservation dialog contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" (dialog text: \\\"Modify Reservation / New Time / 19:30 / Party Size / 2 Guests / Save Changes / Close\\\") — there is no date control, so the date of an upcoming reservation cannot be changed. Time 19:30→20:30 and party size 2→5 did save and display (\\\"August 31, 2026 / 20:30 / 5 Guests\\\"), but the date stayed August 31, 2026 with no way to alter it.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Review authorization constraint not enforced\", \"actual\": \"With zero reservations of any kind (Upcoming (0) / Past (0)), the \\\"Write a Review\\\" form for The Golden Fork was fully available and the submitted review was accepted: banner \\\"Review Submitted!\\\" appeared and the restaurant rating/review count changed from 4.5 (2) to 4.3 (3). No completed-reservation check and no per-reservation review limit exist.\", \"evidence\": \"Reservations page showed \\\"Upcoming (0)\\\" and \\\"Past (0)\\\" immediately before submitting the review.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon eligibility rules not enforced (day rule, first-reservation rule, stale eligibility)\", \"actual\": \"1) WEEKEND20 (\\\"20% off weekend dining\\\") was accepted for Monday Aug 31, 2026. 2) WELCOME10 (\\\"10% off your first reservation\\\") was accepted on a second booking while an existing reservation was already in Upcoming (1). 3) GROUP15 was applied with 6 guests, then party size was lowered to 2 — the coupon stayed applied, submission succeeded and the reservation card records \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\" despite the 6+ rule. Only the initial party-size check (\\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\") and the single-coupon-at-a-time UI behaved correctly.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty form / missing date+time with valid contact info → submission blocked and toast \\\"Missing Information – Please fill in all required fields.\\\" Email field is type=email required; with \\\"not-an-email\\\" submission was blocked with native message \\\"Please include an '@' in the email address...\\\"; name and phone are required (type=tel). No reservation was created in any of these attempts.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify opens a dialog whose supported choices (time, party size) saved with toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\". Cancel opens \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" with Keep Reservation / Cancel Reservation; clicking Keep left Upcoming (2) unchanged, only explicit confirm performed the cancellation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create → \\\"Reservation Confirmed! Your table at Trattoria Bella is booked for August 31, 2026 at 19:30.\\\"; modify → \\\"Reservation Updated\\\"; cancel → \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\". Each time the Upcoming/Past lists and tab counts reflected the new state via in-app navigation only, with no manual reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Separate \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" and \\\"Past (1)\\\" tabs with per-card status badges (\\\"Upcoming\\\" / \\\"Cancelled\\\"). Cards show restaurant name, cuisine·price, status, date, time, party size, location (Little Italy / Warehouse District) and \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\" / \\\"WELCOME10\\\" when present.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating inconsistent between list and detail; list summary not updated by new reviews\", \"actual\": \"The Golden Fork: list card shows 4.8 while detail showed 4.5 (2 reviews) before and 4.3 (3 reviews) after submitting a 4-star review — the list rating stayed 4.8 in both cases. Sakura Garden: list 4.6 vs detail 5.0 (1 review). List cards also show no review count.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
